      "source": "wotc",
      "comment": "Saddled Rimestag\u2019s effect checks each turn whether it applies during that turn. It doesn\u2019t check only during the turn it enters the battlefield."
    },
    {
      "oracle_id": "731898d3-465b-4ecb-a346-b91881714ebc",
      "published_at": "2019-06-14",
      "source": "wotc",
      "comment": "Saddled Rimestag\u2019s effect applies even if the other creature entered the battlefield under your control before Saddled Rimestag entered the battlefield, and it continues to apply even if that creature leaves the battlefield."
    },
    {
      "oracle_id": "731898d3-465b-4ecb-a346-b91881714ebc",
      "published_at": "2019-06-14",
      "source": "wotc",
      "comment": "Saddled Rimestag doesn\u2019t get more than +2/+2 if you had more than one other creature enter the battlefield under your control during a turn."
    },
