      "source": "wotc",
      "comment": "If it's the turn Eldrazi Aggressor comes under your control, and it loses haste after being declared as an attacker, it will continue to attack. It won't be removed from combat."
    },
    {
      "oracle_id": "d17a1109-3a7f-4a39-b602-155da819235f",
